ent-AU14ReinforcedConcreteBag = reinforced concrete bag
    .desc = A heavy bag of concrete mix with steel rods in it. A wall of these withstands a lot more than a plain concrete one. Hold it and pick what to build.
ent-RUMCConcreteWall = concrete wall
    .desc = A wall of cast concrete.
ent-RUMCReinforcedConcreteWall = reinforced concrete wall
    .desc = A wall of concrete cast around steel rods. The claws of the xenos do nothing to it, and the acid does not eat it.
ent-RUMCSolarPanel = solar panel
    .desc = A frame of glass over silicon cells that makes current out of the sun. Face it toward the sun and keep it clear of shade.
ent-RUMCSolarPanelSilver = silver solar panel
    .desc = A panel of silicon cells with silver contacts and a better glass. It makes twice as much as the plain one.
ent-RUMCLeatherItem = leather
    .desc = A piece of tanned leather, soft and strong, ready to be cut into boots and gloves.

au14-craft-recipe-buildsolarpanel = Solar panel
au14-craft-recipe-buildsolarpanelsilver = Silver solar panel
